    specs: [{ label: "Location", value: "Delhi" }, { label: "Category", value: "Residential" }],
    description: "TARC Tripundra is one of the most premium and emerging ultra-luxury residential developments in New Delhi. Strategically located on Bijwasan Road, facing the lush green expanse of Pushpanjali Greens, this project is developed by TARC Limited, a growing name in the luxury real estate segment. 📍 Prime Location Advantage The biggest strength of TARC Tripundra is its strategic South-West Delhi location, offering unmatched connectivity and serene surroundings. The project is just 10–15 minutes from IGI Airport, making it highly convenient for frequent travelers. It also enjoys seamless connectivity to: Dwarka Expressway NH-48 (Delhi–Jaipur Highway) Aerocity & Diplomatic Enclave Gurgaon business hubs Being surrounded by premium farmhouses like Pushpanjali Greens and Rajokri, the project offers a rare combination of greenery + city connectivity, which is uncommon in Delhi. 🏡 Project Overview & Configuration TARC Tripundra is a low-density luxury project with only ~187 exclusive residences, ensuring privacy and exclusivity. The project offers: 3 BHK apartments (~2200 sq. ft.) 4 BHK apartments (~3200 sq. ft.) Each home is designed with spacious layouts, large balconies, and premium interiors, catering to high-end buyers who prioritize comfort and elegance. 🌟 Luxury Lifestyle & Amenities TARC Tripundra is designed as a resort-style living experience, offering world-class amenities such as: All-weather indoor swimming pool Exclusive private theatre Observatory deck Spa & wellness zones Fully equipped gymnasium Kids’ play areas and sports zones The project also features lush landscaped gardens, jogging tracks, and meditation zones, creating a balanced lifestyle focused on wellness and relaxation. 🏗️ Smart Living & Security A major highlight of the project is its focus on smart home technology and advanced security. Residents get: App-controlled smart home systems Digital locks and access control Wi-Fi-enabled common areas EV charging points Additionally, the project offers 7-layer security, including CCTV surveillance, RFID entry, and secured parking, ensuring a safe and secure living environment. 🌱 Sustainability & Green Living TARC Tripundra is an IGBC Gold-certified project, emphasizing eco-friendly and sustainable living. Key sustainability features include: Energy-efficient HVAC systems Rainwater harvesting Waste management systems Solar power utilization Air filtration systems in common areas These features promote a healthier lifestyle while reducing environmental impact. 💰 Investment Potential From an investment perspective, TARC Tripundra holds strong potential due to: Prime Delhi location with limited new supply Low-density luxury concept (high demand among HNIs) Proximity to airport & Gurgaon Growing brand value of TARC Prices typically fall in the ₹6–9 crore+ range, depending on size and configuration (market estimates). The project is also nearing possession (around 2025), making it attractive for both end-users and investors. 🏢 Developer Profile The project is developed by TARC Limited, a Delhi-based luxury real estate company. About the Developer: Focus on ultra-luxury residential projects in Delhi NCR Known for projects like TARC Kailasa & TARC Ishva Emphasis on design, sustainability, and premium living TARC is still an emerging luxury brand, but it is gaining traction in the high-end segment. 🚀 Why Choose TARC Tripundra? Prime location near airport & Gurgaon Low-density project (only ~187 units) Spacious 3 & 4 BHK luxury homes Resort-style amenities & smart features Strong future appreciation potential 🏁 Conclusion TARC Tripundra is a rare ultra-luxury offering in Delhi that combines privacy, connectivity, and premium lifestyle. With its low-density planning, modern amenities, and strategic location, it stands out as a strong option for both end-users and investors. If you are looking for luxury living near airport + Gurgaon connectivity, this project is definitely worth considering.",
