    specs: [{ label: "Location", value: "Delhi" }, { label: "Category", value: "Residential" }],
    description: "Godrej Connaught One is one of the most prestigious ultra-luxury residential developments in India, located in the heart of Connaught Place. Developed by Godrej Properties, this project offers a rare opportunity to own a premium residence in Delhi’s most iconic and centrally located area. 📍 Prime Location Advantage The biggest highlight of this project is its prime location in Connaught Place (CP)—often referred to as the commercial and cultural heart of Delhi. The address itself carries immense prestige, as CP is surrounded by key landmarks such as: India Gate Rashtrapati Bhavan Parliament House The project is situated near Bangla Sahib Road, offering excellent connectivity to all parts of Delhi via road, metro, and public transport. The Rajiv Chowk Metro Station is just minutes away, ensuring seamless connectivity across NCR. Living here means being at the center of everything—business hubs, luxury hotels, shopping destinations, and fine dining—all within close proximity. 🏡 Project Overview & Design Spread across approximately 1 acre, Godrej Connaught One is a low-density luxury development featuring just 46 exclusive residences in a single iconic tower. The project offers: 3 BHK and 4 BHK luxury apartments Sizes ranging from ~2200 sq. ft. to 3100 sq. ft. This limited inventory ensures maximum privacy, exclusivity, and spacious living, which is extremely rare in central Delhi. The design blends modern architecture with the classic charm of Lutyens’ Delhi, creating a timeless and elegant living experience. 🌟 Ultra-Luxury Lifestyle & Amenities Godrej Connaught One is positioned as a “7-star living experience”, offering world-class amenities such as: Temperature-controlled swimming pool Luxury spa & salon High-end gymnasium Concierge services Private party decks and lounges The project is designed to deliver a hotel-like lifestyle, catering to HNIs, business leaders, and diplomats. 🏗️ Architecture & Features The project emphasizes: High ceilings and large living spaces Premium interiors and finishes Landscaped green areas Advanced security systems It also includes a grand entrance lobby (approx. 20 ft high), enhancing the luxury feel from the moment you enter. The low-rise (G+8 approx.) structure ensures privacy and exclusivity, unlike crowded high-rise developments. 💰 Price & Investment Potential Godrej Connaught One falls in the ultra-luxury segment, with prices typically ranging from: ₹15–16 crore onwards (3 BHK) Up to ₹25 crore+ (4 BHK) depending on size and configuration Why Investment is Strong: Extremely limited supply in Connaught Place High demand from elite buyers & NRIs Strong capital appreciation potential Premium rental value due to location Central Delhi rarely sees new residential launches, making this project a once-in-a-generation opportunity. 🏢 Developer Profile The project is developed by Godrej Properties, one of India’s most trusted and reputed real estate developers. About the Developer: Part of the Godrej Group (125+ years legacy) Known for premium residential & commercial projects Strong track record of quality and timely delivery The project is being developed under Godrej Projects North LLP and is RERA registered (DLRERA2022P0001), ensuring transparency. 📊 Project Highlights Ultra-luxury residences in Connaught Place Only 46 exclusive apartments 3 & 4 BHK configurations 7-star lifestyle amenities Strong investment and appreciation potential Possession expected around 2025 🏁 Conclusion Godrej Connaught One is not just a residential project—it is a status symbol and legacy investment. With its unmatched location, ultra-luxury positioning, and limited inventory, it stands among the most exclusive residential offerings in India. If you are looking for: A trophy property in Delhi Ultra-luxury lifestyle Long-term capital appreciation This project is one of the best options in the NCR luxury segment.",
